  "title": "Wolf 1.05 m",
  "description": "A grey wolf standing on all fours, 2 m long. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1050 mm tall (411 x 2050 x 1050 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 4 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/wolf/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 1962 triangles.",
